WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.039
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.130 --> 01:42.940
[Episode 04]

02:00.410 --> 02:01.930
Senior, you're hurt.

02:02.770 --> 02:04.570
It must hurt.

02:04.570 --> 02:05.580
Have a candy.

02:05.580 --> 02:07.640
You won't feel so sad after.

02:12.470 --> 02:13.680
After I have learned my skills,

02:13.680 --> 02:14.900
I'll protect you,

02:14.900 --> 02:17.090
just like Master protected us.

02:17.090 --> 02:18.750
I won't let you get hurt again.

02:19.270 --> 02:21.270
Junior, I'll wait for you to grow up.

02:44.410 --> 02:44.950
Senior.

02:44.960 --> 02:45.560
Watch out!

02:49.090 --> 02:49.720
Senior.

02:52.160 --> 02:53.710
Senior, why are you here?

02:53.710 --> 02:55.100
I heard you were injured.

02:55.100 --> 02:56.440
I came right away.

02:56.480 --> 02:58.040
I asked someone to distract Wang Jian,

02:58.040 --> 02:59.640
and came to see you secretly.

03:03.830 --> 03:04.920
Take the medicine.

03:04.970 --> 03:06.500
I made it specially for you.

03:06.690 --> 03:07.400
Sister,

03:08.240 --> 03:09.880
I'm not a kid.

03:10.170 --> 03:11.170
I can do it myself.

03:14.330 --> 03:14.960
Senior.

03:15.930 --> 03:17.690
Liu Shao didn't make any trouble

03:17.690 --> 03:19.290
in the past few days, did she?

03:20.670 --> 03:21.720
No.

03:21.850 --> 03:23.020
If anything happens,

03:23.020 --> 03:24.070
I'm here.

03:24.540 --> 03:25.500
Besides,

03:25.630 --> 03:26.960
you still care about her

03:27.100 --> 03:28.630
when you're sick yourself.

03:30.040 --> 03:31.050
Actually,

03:31.510 --> 03:32.970
it's not Liu Shao's fault.

03:33.440 --> 03:34.910
She didn't mean it.

03:35.200 --> 03:36.550
I don't blame her.

03:36.760 --> 03:37.770
I just hope

03:37.890 --> 03:39.220
you can get better soon.

03:40.120 --> 03:41.630
Do you remember?

03:41.630 --> 03:43.160
In order to practice magic,

03:43.180 --> 03:45.280
we've been injured constantly since we were young.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.880
We've been supporting each other

03:46.880 --> 03:48.520
all the way here.

03:49.950 --> 03:51.120
Master and Senior

03:51.750 --> 03:53.680
are the most important people to me.

03:53.680 --> 03:55.490
I'll do my best to protect you.

03:55.950 --> 03:57.480
I won't let anyone hurt you.

03:59.020 --> 04:00.080
Take the medicine.

04:16.529 --> 04:19.810
The Moon Washing Stone won't be too far from the Moon Washing Pond.

04:19.810 --> 04:23.080
Try to infer from the prayers

04:24.390 --> 04:28.420
and go again on a full moon night.

04:28.670 --> 04:30.100
It won't be hard to find.

04:31.860 --> 04:34.300
The next full moon night is just around the corner.

04:34.300 --> 04:36.560
I wonder if Wang Jian has sent my message.

04:50.590 --> 04:51.640
Little girl.

04:52.230 --> 04:52.940
Lu Li.

04:53.990 --> 04:56.190
I've been looking for you. You're here.

04:57.350 --> 04:58.680
Are you feeling better?

05:00.840 --> 05:02.240
Are you worried about me?

05:02.650 --> 05:04.050
With the Lord healing me,

05:04.580 --> 05:05.500
this injury

05:05.750 --> 05:06.720
is nothing.

05:07.430 --> 05:08.480
Just wait.

05:08.690 --> 05:09.750
I'll recover soon.

05:11.590 --> 05:12.590
Let's make a deal.

05:12.980 --> 05:13.900
We will

05:14.450 --> 05:16.450
practice hunting demons together.

05:17.140 --> 05:19.000
I will wait for you to come with me.

05:19.190 --> 05:19.610
Okay.

05:19.950 --> 05:20.750
Remember,

05:21.040 --> 05:22.900
this trip to the Moon Washing Pond

05:23.140 --> 05:24.600
is different from before.

05:24.780 --> 05:25.910
On a full moon night,

05:26.080 --> 05:27.610
demons appear frequently.

05:27.640 --> 05:29.440
Even Ao Hen may be alarmed.

05:30.320 --> 05:31.630
If you are in danger,

05:32.210 --> 05:33.180
I

05:33.850 --> 05:35.310
may not be able to save you.

05:36.030 --> 05:36.580
Liu Shao.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.770
What are you thinking about?

05:41.120 --> 05:42.210
Nothing.

05:44.310 --> 05:45.480
Actually,

05:45.480 --> 05:47.290
I have something to tell you.

05:47.710 --> 05:48.930
But when I see you,

05:48.930 --> 05:50.940
I don't know what to say.

05:52.250 --> 05:53.510
Oh.

05:55.480 --> 05:56.820
You came to talk to me.

05:57.200 --> 05:59.659
You don't know how to say it after meeting me.

06:00.270 --> 06:02.120
This is beyond my duty.

06:02.120 --> 06:03.800
It's not easy to set the price.

06:05.100 --> 06:06.190
Lu Li.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.050
You...

06:10.850 --> 06:11.310
Come.

06:11.730 --> 06:12.240
Here.

06:16.690 --> 06:17.240
Take it.

06:18.870 --> 06:20.050
What is this?

06:20.600 --> 06:21.690
This is a recording stone.

06:21.690 --> 06:23.160
It can store what you want to say.

06:23.160 --> 06:23.790
Of course,

06:24.330 --> 06:26.330
it can also record what others said.

06:26.980 --> 06:28.110
Is it that magical?

06:28.110 --> 06:28.620
Yes.

06:30.420 --> 06:31.390
In this case,

06:31.730 --> 06:33.930
you don't have to wait for me for so long.

06:39.830 --> 06:41.810
Then put it here.

06:41.810 --> 06:43.530
I'll record messages for you later.

06:43.530 --> 06:44.030
Okay.

06:46.930 --> 06:47.990
It's getting late.

06:48.610 --> 06:50.140
You should go back and rest.

06:50.500 --> 06:51.040
Okay.

06:59.280 --> 07:00.490
He gave me this.

07:01.250 --> 07:03.060
Does he have a lot

07:03.640 --> 07:04.900
to tell me too?

07:15.490 --> 07:19.480
♫I said I miss you because of your name♫

07:19.820 --> 07:23.580
♫I'll spend the rest of my life with you♫

07:23.910 --> 07:26.760
♫I can't tell dreams apart♫

07:26.760 --> 07:31.610
♫Let love continue after flowers bloom♫

07:31.850 --> 07:36.050
♫I said I miss you, don't doubt me♫

07:36.300 --> 07:39.920
♫You left traces in my life♫

07:40.270 --> 07:43.190
♫I want to be with you♫

07:42.909 --> 07:43.590
Lu Li.

07:43.190 --> 07:47.860
♫Spring comes and winter goes. Let love continue♫

07:44.220 --> 07:45.480
Wait for me.

07:47.860 --> 07:52.180
♫I think the world can't hear♫

07:52.180 --> 07:55.820
♫The four seasons have been circulating for a thousand years♫

07:56.300 --> 08:02.190
♫You whispered forever to me♫

08:04.290 --> 08:06.050
When a liar doesn't lie,

08:06.600 --> 08:08.150
he's quite cute.

08:10.550 --> 08:12.690
You must get better soon.

08:45.790 --> 08:47.930
[Wu]

08:47.840 --> 08:50.030
The moon is bright.

08:50.030 --> 08:51.790
The water is surging.

08:52.510 --> 08:53.770
According to the prayers,

08:53.770 --> 08:57.500
[Wu]

08:54.100 --> 08:55.320
if I walk along the water

08:55.320 --> 08:56.620
on a full moon night.

08:56.870 --> 08:59.470
I should be able to find the Moon Washing Stone.

09:01.160 --> 09:03.430
There is no Moon Washing Stone.

09:03.430 --> 09:05.160
Aren't these ordinary stones?

09:12.330 --> 09:13.670
The beautiful stone is like jade.

09:13.670 --> 09:15.020
It shines brightly

09:15.020 --> 09:16.570
like it has been washed by moonlight.

09:16.570 --> 09:18.000
This must be the Moon Washing Stone.

09:18.000 --> 09:19.000
It can't be wrong.

09:25.430 --> 09:26.060
Found it!

09:28.880 --> 09:29.880
Where is the herb?

09:34.840 --> 09:36.730
When you find the Moon Washing Stone,

09:36.730 --> 09:38.750
irrigate it with blood.

09:42.150 --> 09:43.110
The King Herb

09:43.700 --> 09:45.630
will grow out of it.

10:28.510 --> 10:30.030
Brother, how do you feel?

10:32.670 --> 10:34.560
Although Wu Yang Duke has recuperated your body,

10:34.560 --> 10:36.410
but your vitality is badly damaged.

10:36.410 --> 10:37.670
You need to nourish it.

10:37.920 --> 10:39.430
It's okay.

10:39.430 --> 10:41.320
I have the resilience of a wild dog.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.780
I've been fine for a while.

10:43.890 --> 10:45.100
Your soup is good.

10:45.730 --> 10:46.930
You're quite filial.

10:47.670 --> 10:48.380
Have more.

10:51.450 --> 10:52.050
By the way,

10:52.610 --> 10:54.390
when did Liu Shao say she was going to hunt demons?

10:54.390 --> 10:56.280
Should I prepare now?

10:57.070 --> 10:59.220
You still care about her at this point?

10:59.470 --> 11:01.800
You still say you have no feelings for her?

11:02.200 --> 11:03.000
Man.

11:04.340 --> 11:05.470
You...

11:05.470 --> 11:06.730
You don't understand.

11:06.800 --> 11:09.760
I do things for her for money.

11:10.470 --> 11:11.520
Besides,

11:11.690 --> 11:13.500
I'm working with injuries.

11:13.830 --> 11:15.640
If she doesn't give me 3,000 or 5,000 taels,

11:15.640 --> 11:17.110
it'll be inappropriate, right?

11:17.110 --> 11:17.860
Yes.

11:17.860 --> 11:18.660
You're right.

11:18.830 --> 11:20.220
But you can't make the money.

11:20.220 --> 11:21.270
Maybe before you recover,

11:21.270 --> 11:22.800
she already got the demons.

11:29.290 --> 11:30.290
That's not right.

11:31.390 --> 11:32.690
Every time I have soup,

11:32.980 --> 11:34.620
you have more than me.

11:35.500 --> 11:37.430
You didn't even touch it this time.

11:39.240 --> 11:40.840
Something is wrong with you.

11:42.640 --> 11:44.030
Brother, don't blame me.

11:44.030 --> 11:45.250
It was all Liu Shao's idea.

11:45.250 --> 11:46.000
She promised the Lord

11:46.000 --> 11:47.390
to find the King Herb in the Moon Washing Pond.

11:47.390 --> 11:48.900
That's why he used up his vitality to save you.

11:48.900 --> 11:49.660
Liu Shao didn't want you to worry,

11:49.660 --> 11:51.520
so she didn't allow me to tell you.

11:51.670 --> 11:53.130
You're being ridiculous.

11:53.350 --> 11:54.150
Brother.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.910
Brother, I gave her all the spells.

11:55.910 --> 11:56.540
Brother.

11:58.900 --> 11:59.690
Wait for me.

12:00.240 --> 12:01.540
I'll get even with you.

12:02.170 --> 12:03.350
No, brother.

12:03.600 --> 12:06.790
[Wu]

12:07.250 --> 12:08.560
It turned out that

12:08.680 --> 12:10.480
this King Herb was so easy to get.

12:11.030 --> 12:12.250
I thought

12:12.550 --> 12:14.080
it would be very difficult.

12:16.540 --> 12:19.690
That's because God of the Moonlight and God of the Sun

12:19.900 --> 12:22.370
acknowledged the power in your blood.

12:22.960 --> 12:26.240
The King Herb nurtured by their residual spiritual power

12:26.530 --> 12:28.630
will naturally accept you.

12:29.770 --> 12:30.650
Who are you?

12:31.240 --> 12:32.200
Come out!

12:32.200 --> 12:34.330
I'm telling you. Don't scare me again.

12:51.900 --> 12:52.610
Ao Hen.

12:54.710 --> 12:56.060
I didn't expect

12:56.770 --> 12:58.790
other than you,

12:59.540 --> 13:01.430
I can get another bonus.

13:01.680 --> 13:03.110
I'll take

13:03.530 --> 13:04.500
both of you.

13:16.260 --> 13:18.740
Is the lantern from the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

13:18.740 --> 13:19.950
This lantern

13:19.950 --> 13:22.890
can only scare the little Aquatic Demons.

13:23.860 --> 13:26.460
How dare you threaten me with it?

13:27.390 --> 13:28.770
In your dreams!

13:50.530 --> 13:51.870
Invisible Amulet!

14:18.540 --> 14:19.300
Oh no!

14:19.300 --> 14:21.270
You think you can escape

14:21.520 --> 14:23.830
with just a few amulets?

15:08.270 --> 15:09.700
Demon King in White.

15:09.700 --> 15:10.540
Ao Hen.

15:10.830 --> 15:12.430
It's time to settle the score

15:12.680 --> 15:14.060
between you and my clan.

15:15.110 --> 15:16.160
Settle the score?

15:16.330 --> 15:18.260
How dare you meddle in my business?

15:19.400 --> 15:20.990
What if I insist?

16:10.720 --> 16:11.850
Demon King in White,

16:12.360 --> 16:14.710
I'll remember this.

16:34.910 --> 16:37.390
You're the Demon King in White?

16:38.150 --> 16:38.690
No.

16:39.450 --> 16:41.800
There's no Demon King who's hard to track down.

16:41.800 --> 16:43.440
I just pretended to be the Demon King in White

16:43.440 --> 16:44.740
to scare her away.

16:46.130 --> 16:47.090
You're amazing.

16:47.550 --> 16:49.150
But I still have to thank you.

16:51.040 --> 16:52.100
I don't help others

16:53.220 --> 16:54.230
for free.

16:55.620 --> 16:56.420
Of course.

16:56.920 --> 16:59.120
How much do you want? I'll give it to you.

17:02.300 --> 17:03.500
Where is my King Herb?

17:21.490 --> 17:22.890
This is the reward I want.

17:24.300 --> 17:25.390
Sorry.

17:25.390 --> 17:27.619
My brother needs the King Herb to save his life.

17:27.619 --> 17:29.550
I'll make it up to you in the future.

17:29.590 --> 17:31.520
But I must make you forget me first.

17:40.430 --> 17:41.690
Where is the King Herb?

17:41.980 --> 17:42.490
No.

17:43.030 --> 17:44.160
That man in white...

17:44.970 --> 17:45.850
In white...

17:46.390 --> 17:47.950
What does he look like?

17:48.580 --> 17:50.430
Why can't I remember anything?

17:51.140 --> 17:51.850
Hello?

17:52.150 --> 17:53.320
Is anyone there?

17:53.790 --> 17:56.050
That herb is very important to me.

17:58.320 --> 17:59.670
If I can't bring it back,

17:59.670 --> 18:01.730
I'll break my promise to Wu Yang Duke.

18:01.890 --> 18:03.660
The human world will be in big trouble.

18:03.660 --> 18:04.870
What should I do?

18:05.460 --> 18:06.260
Hello?

18:06.260 --> 18:07.310
Is anyone there?

18:07.770 --> 18:09.910
Where are you? Give me back the herb!

18:16.720 --> 18:19.910
[Palace of Aquatic Demons]

18:45.740 --> 18:47.290
[Wu]

18:49.100 --> 18:49.770
Liu Shao.

18:50.480 --> 18:51.200
Liu Shao.

18:53.300 --> 18:54.520
Liu Shao.

18:58.040 --> 18:58.630
Liu Shao.

19:00.140 --> 19:01.340
You must not get hurt.

19:07.120 --> 19:07.830
Liu Shao.

19:09.970 --> 19:11.100
I finally found you.

19:11.650 --> 19:12.870
Don't do this again.

19:13.250 --> 19:14.650
Acting alone without me.

19:16.310 --> 19:17.240
What's wrong?

19:27.440 --> 19:28.750
I'm not hurt.

19:29.670 --> 19:31.010
But Ao Hen came after me.

19:32.230 --> 19:33.030
The King Herb.

19:34.460 --> 19:35.860
The King Herb is gone too.

19:38.990 --> 19:40.250
Isn't that dangerous?

19:42.230 --> 19:43.360
Are you really okay?

19:44.660 --> 19:45.920
I'm really fine.

19:47.350 --> 19:48.820
But the herb is gone.

19:50.120 --> 19:52.810
Then I have nothing to hand over to the Lord.

19:54.150 --> 19:55.200
It will be fine.

19:55.790 --> 19:57.850
You lost the herb. We can think of another way.

19:57.850 --> 19:58.850
It's all my fault.

20:00.080 --> 20:01.340
You too.

20:01.340 --> 20:03.540
Why did you come to this dangerous place

20:04.190 --> 20:05.330
without telling me?

20:07.890 --> 20:09.060
If something really happened,

20:09.060 --> 20:10.450
how could I be at ease?

20:13.050 --> 20:15.280
You're injured. I'm worried about you.

20:15.870 --> 20:17.550
I hope you can rest well.

20:18.390 --> 20:19.190
Besides,

20:19.350 --> 20:20.810
whenever I was in trouble,

20:20.870 --> 20:23.130
didn't you also risk your life to help me?

20:24.770 --> 20:27.880
I can't always let you stand in front of me.

20:31.450 --> 20:34.640
[Wu]

20:33.380 --> 20:34.640
What a silly girl.

20:35.150 --> 20:35.820
From now on,

20:36.620 --> 20:38.020
I will always be with you.

21:30.370 --> 21:34.830
[King Fu, General of Water of Aquatic Demons]

22:13.300 --> 22:14.140
Fu.

22:14.140 --> 22:15.100
You barely recovered.

22:15.100 --> 22:16.700
Now is not the time to settle the score with Ao Hen.

22:16.700 --> 22:17.160
But at least,

22:17.160 --> 22:19.090
I have to save the rest of my people.

22:31.310 --> 22:32.950
You haven't fully recovered yet.

22:32.950 --> 22:34.280
Don't go out for a while.

22:34.800 --> 22:36.230
Stay here and rest.

22:36.940 --> 22:39.130
I'm doing it for my clan. Why are you stopping me?

22:39.130 --> 22:40.550
They are your clan,

22:40.550 --> 22:41.810
but also my people.

22:42.740 --> 22:43.800
I am the Demon King.

22:44.420 --> 22:45.640
I know what to do.

22:52.020 --> 22:53.280
Take care of yourself.

22:54.120 --> 22:55.550
Don't worry about the clan.

22:55.550 --> 22:57.100
I'll find a way.

22:57.100 --> 22:58.070
Demon King.

23:12.890 --> 23:17.600
[Yu Yu Hall]

23:24.530 --> 23:25.620
I've told you

23:26.750 --> 23:28.770
how much trouble the loss of the King Herb would

23:28.770 --> 23:30.910
bring to the human world.

23:37.840 --> 23:38.600
Bai Feng.

23:39.650 --> 23:41.030
Didn't I ask you to check

23:41.030 --> 23:43.290
the demons next to the Moon Washing Pond?

23:44.430 --> 23:45.230
My Lord,

23:46.240 --> 23:48.000
I did check them one by one.

23:48.630 --> 23:51.360
But I didn't find Ao Hen or her subordinates.

23:52.160 --> 23:54.680
Aquatic Demons frequent the Moon Washing Pond.

23:54.680 --> 23:56.240
But they always keep their promises.

23:55.650 --> 23:59.130
[Wu]

23:56.240 --> 23:58.210
When they see the lanterns from the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke,

23:58.210 --> 23:59.720
they would back off.

23:59.720 --> 24:02.920
They wouldn't make things difficult for Junior Liu Shao.

24:04.550 --> 24:06.360
The one who took my King Herb

24:06.360 --> 24:07.740
was in white.

24:07.740 --> 24:09.740
He was very skilled in martial arts.

24:10.260 --> 24:11.480
Could it be

24:11.780 --> 24:13.110
the Demon King in White?

24:14.630 --> 24:15.850
That's impossible.

24:15.850 --> 24:18.790
The Demon King in White is a modest and scrupulous gentleman.

24:18.790 --> 24:21.730
How could he be hostile to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

24:23.870 --> 24:25.170
I think

24:25.170 --> 24:27.270
with Liu Shao's cultivation,

24:27.270 --> 24:29.160
it's a miracle that

24:29.160 --> 24:30.630
she returned safely.

24:32.060 --> 24:33.610
Ao Hen the great demon

24:34.030 --> 24:35.630
and the Demon King in White,

24:36.430 --> 24:38.360
these big shots of the demonic world

24:38.360 --> 24:39.830
both let you go.

24:40.840 --> 24:42.010
I wonder what Liu Shao

24:42.010 --> 24:43.860
promised them?

24:44.160 --> 24:45.290
Otherwise, how could you escape

24:45.290 --> 24:47.420
from such a powerful demon like Ao Hen?

24:48.190 --> 24:48.940
My Lord,

24:49.700 --> 24:50.960
I think

24:50.960 --> 24:53.020
Junior Liu Shao is very talented.

24:53.020 --> 24:55.540
If she uses the heaven and earth treasures to strengthen her spiritual power,

24:55.540 --> 24:56.630
she will be able to cultivate to become a master,

24:56.630 --> 24:58.650
she will naturally be treated differently by the great demons.

24:58.650 --> 24:59.700
Treated differently?

24:59.700 --> 25:01.630
Unless she betrayed the human race

25:01.880 --> 25:03.010
and became a demon.

25:06.500 --> 25:07.630
Liu Shao is a demon.

25:07.630 --> 25:08.890
Maybe she has really become a demon.

25:08.890 --> 25:09.860
No wonder she's so powerful.

25:09.860 --> 25:10.990
It's a shame the Lord trusted her so much.

25:10.990 --> 25:12.130
Xi died without any clear reason

25:12.130 --> 25:13.470
after offending her.

25:17.250 --> 25:18.260
Senior,

25:18.260 --> 25:19.350
if I were a demon,

25:19.350 --> 25:21.810
how could I enter the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke?

25:22.960 --> 25:24.310
If you don't believe me,

25:24.310 --> 25:25.950
I'll leave the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

25:25.950 --> 25:26.580
Liu Shao.

25:26.580 --> 25:27.210
What?

25:27.210 --> 25:28.470
You took the King Herb,

25:28.470 --> 25:30.070
and now you want to walk away?

25:30.310 --> 25:31.110
Of course not.

25:31.700 --> 25:32.760
Liu Shao meant that

25:33.250 --> 25:35.390
she wants to go out and find the King Herb.

25:35.390 --> 25:37.240
She wants to find the King Herb?

25:43.120 --> 25:43.920
My Lord,

25:45.350 --> 25:46.810
if I get the King Herb back,

25:47.320 --> 25:49.250
can it prove Liu Shao's innocence?

25:54.670 --> 25:55.340
Yes.

25:56.690 --> 25:57.190
OK.

25:58.230 --> 25:59.630
Please give me some time.

25:59.910 --> 26:01.710
I will find the King Herb for you.

26:06.100 --> 26:06.770
Lu Li.

26:07.820 --> 26:08.870
The King Herb

26:11.090 --> 26:13.740
only grows one plant in a hundred years.

26:14.030 --> 26:15.210
Can you do it?

26:16.430 --> 26:17.310
I can.

26:18.110 --> 26:19.070
If I can't,

26:19.580 --> 26:21.710
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

26:25.250 --> 26:26.380
Please

26:26.380 --> 26:27.350
give us a chance.

26:41.000 --> 26:41.630
Brother,

26:43.310 --> 26:45.440
can you really get the King Herb again?

26:45.450 --> 26:47.340
The King Herb grows for a hundred years.

26:47.340 --> 26:48.890
There is only one in the world.

26:48.890 --> 26:50.450
How could I get it so easily?

26:51.290 --> 26:52.420
I'm not an immortal.

26:53.390 --> 26:55.230
So you did it to buy time.

27:01.620 --> 27:03.380
Why are you so down?

27:04.180 --> 27:05.400
We still have time.

27:05.940 --> 27:07.040
Don't worry.

27:08.590 --> 27:09.350
I'm here.

27:09.930 --> 27:10.560
It's okay.

27:13.500 --> 27:14.260
Yeah.

27:15.140 --> 27:15.690
Yeah.

27:15.690 --> 27:17.070
We're here for you.

27:19.970 --> 27:20.770
Liu Shao.

27:21.650 --> 27:23.580
I won't let anything happen to you.

27:23.630 --> 27:24.690
Do you understand?

27:27.070 --> 27:28.410
Then think about it carefully again.

27:28.410 --> 27:30.300
That fake Demon King whose face you didn't see clearly,

27:30.300 --> 27:31.350
he's in white,

27:31.820 --> 27:33.480
and he can turn water into ice.

27:33.580 --> 27:35.380
Is there anything else special?

27:43.700 --> 27:46.160
There's a pendant on his flute. It's pretty.

27:46.430 --> 27:47.690
What does it look like?

27:52.230 --> 27:52.830
Like this.

27:54.370 --> 27:55.970
Every flute looks like this.

27:56.640 --> 27:57.100
No, no, no.

27:57.100 --> 27:57.980
It's different.

27:57.980 --> 27:58.320
Here.

27:58.740 --> 28:00.630
There is a flower, very special.

28:00.630 --> 28:02.090
I've never seen it before.

28:03.270 --> 28:04.320
Draw it for me.

28:04.530 --> 28:04.910
Okay.

28:07.770 --> 28:09.030
Like this.

28:14.020 --> 28:15.280
Forget it.

28:15.540 --> 28:17.070
You describe. I'll draw it.

28:20.110 --> 28:20.700
I draw.

28:21.330 --> 28:22.330
Watch carefully.

28:26.120 --> 28:27.850
This is eichhornia crassipes.

28:28.890 --> 28:32.020
These are the patterns of the royalty of Aquatic Demons.

28:32.250 --> 28:35.510
The only one who can control all spirits in the Three Realms

28:36.580 --> 28:38.980
with the melody of a flute is the Demon King.

28:45.020 --> 28:46.410
Good Heavens.

28:46.660 --> 28:48.660
He's really the Demon King in White.

28:48.670 --> 28:49.870
He's not an imposter.

28:57.160 --> 28:59.760
This time, I'll tear Ao Hen into pieces.

29:00.060 --> 29:02.360
Aquatic Demons have been cursed for generations.

29:02.360 --> 29:03.290
We live by water.

29:03.710 --> 29:05.570
If we leave the water, we will die.

29:06.020 --> 29:07.150
You just recovered.

29:07.570 --> 29:09.630
Why are you going to find Ao Hen again?

29:10.050 --> 29:11.810
She killed my clan for the demon energy.

29:11.810 --> 29:13.120
How can I put up with it?

29:14.210 --> 29:14.880
Brother,

29:15.340 --> 29:17.020
why not try to overthrow the Four Seasons Monument,

29:17.020 --> 29:18.020
eliminate Ao Hen,

29:18.320 --> 29:19.720
unify the demonic realm,

29:20.090 --> 29:21.560
and welcome the God of the Moonlight back.

29:21.560 --> 29:23.160
Let him lift the curse for us.

29:23.740 --> 29:24.790
But Fu,

29:25.340 --> 29:27.140
don't you know

29:27.140 --> 29:29.600
what the Supreme God under the monument did?

29:30.000 --> 29:33.780
Can you guarantee that he won't cause trouble to the Three Realms again?

29:33.780 --> 29:35.290
Do you still hope

29:35.460 --> 29:37.180
to find the inheritor of Immortal Ze Shui

29:37.180 --> 29:38.320
to lift the curse?

29:40.670 --> 29:42.000
I have a clue about this.

29:45.790 --> 29:47.140
The dignified Demons

29:47.430 --> 29:49.450
has to rely on a woman to save.

29:50.240 --> 29:51.800
No wonder even the little demons under Ao Hen

29:51.800 --> 29:53.560
disregarded Aquatic Demons.

29:54.990 --> 29:56.750
I have only one creed.

29:57.300 --> 29:58.600
If you humiliate my clan,

29:58.600 --> 30:00.030
I'll cut you into pieces.

30:02.130 --> 30:02.760
What?

30:03.140 --> 30:06.710
Your Majesty are going to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke with that girl?

30:06.710 --> 30:07.510
That's right.

30:08.140 --> 30:09.400
She's not afraid of the sound of my Melody Flute.

30:09.400 --> 30:10.530
It's most likely that

30:10.530 --> 30:13.010
she's the reincarnation of Immortal Ze Shui.

30:13.010 --> 30:13.680
If that girl

30:13.680 --> 30:16.140
is really the inheritor of Immortal Ze Shui,

30:16.370 --> 30:17.630
we will have a chance

30:17.630 --> 30:18.960
to save Aquatic Demons.

30:21.700 --> 30:23.380
When do you plan to leave?

30:28.170 --> 30:28.590
A few days ago,

30:28.590 --> 30:29.990
I made a fish demon double

30:30.440 --> 30:31.490
to follow her.

30:32.030 --> 30:33.490
But it can't last for long.

30:34.260 --> 30:35.600
I need to go there soon.

30:36.270 --> 30:36.820
Okay.

30:37.660 --> 30:39.420
I'll arrange it now.

31:02.440 --> 31:03.490
It must be here.

31:17.520 --> 31:18.920
Regarding the King Herb,

31:19.160 --> 31:21.160
I must repay this girl in the future.

31:21.760 --> 31:23.400
But now for Aquatic Demons,

31:23.820 --> 31:26.750
I have to confirm if she's the person I'm looking for.

31:27.300 --> 31:28.900
I need a drop of her blood.

31:35.910 --> 31:36.920
Demon King.

31:37.630 --> 31:38.470
Who is it?

31:54.140 --> 31:54.770
Oh no.

31:55.320 --> 31:56.850
We can't stay here for long.

32:01.280 --> 32:02.880
Such a powerful spell

32:05.190 --> 32:07.650
must be the trick of Lu Sheng, the half demon.

32:29.840 --> 32:31.060
You must be anxious.

32:32.020 --> 32:33.740
I'll let you out now.

32:41.600 --> 32:42.610
Go.

32:42.610 --> 32:44.540
Find someone you should deal with.

32:51.300 --> 32:52.100
Lu Li.

32:52.640 --> 32:55.120
Since you want to climb above me so badly,

32:55.750 --> 32:57.310
enjoy

32:57.310 --> 32:59.870
the gift I gave you.

33:12.800 --> 33:13.690
Lu Li.

33:14.270 --> 33:15.490
I know

33:15.490 --> 33:18.600
you've been running around for me.

33:20.240 --> 33:22.670
Although you have a sharp tongue,

33:24.610 --> 33:25.660
but

33:26.030 --> 33:27.880
when they suspected me,

33:28.220 --> 33:31.070
you trusted me and helped me.

33:32.120 --> 33:33.850
Knowing that you're good to me,

33:33.850 --> 33:35.190
I'm happy.

33:35.860 --> 33:37.080
I'm very happy.

33:38.680 --> 33:39.310
Lu Li.

33:39.770 --> 33:41.360
When I was young,

33:41.740 --> 33:43.670
I wanted to learn skills

33:43.670 --> 33:46.270
to see mountains, rivers, the sun and the moon,

33:46.650 --> 33:48.750
and the stars of the four seas.

33:49.470 --> 33:51.150
That's what I want now too.

33:52.160 --> 33:53.250
But

33:53.580 --> 33:55.780
I hope I can have someone to accompany me

33:56.150 --> 33:57.780
to go through the clouds and the sea

33:57.780 --> 34:00.980
to experience the magnificent life.

34:02.910 --> 34:04.170
I hope

34:06.440 --> 34:07.910
that person is you.

34:10.260 --> 34:11.429
Will you?

34:12.440 --> 34:13.570
I hope

34:14.070 --> 34:15.620
that person is you.

34:16.510 --> 34:18.510
-Will you? -What am I talking about?

34:19.460 --> 34:21.300
How do I get rid of this?

34:22.520 --> 34:23.070
Hello?

34:26.050 --> 34:26.429
Who?

34:32.429 --> 34:33.230
It's me.

34:33.900 --> 34:35.460
How long have you been here?

34:36.550 --> 34:38.690
Not long.

34:38.989 --> 34:41.040
I just came here.

34:42.810 --> 34:43.350
Yes.

34:44.239 --> 34:46.880
I've found clues about the King Herb.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.210
You don't need to worry.

34:51.330 --> 34:54.100
Tomorrow is the first time we go out for demon hunting.

34:54.100 --> 34:55.780
You need to stay alert.

34:56.120 --> 34:57.380
Go back and rest early.

34:59.140 --> 35:00.870
You too.

35:02.380 --> 35:03.180
I'm leaving.

35:47.070 --> 35:48.270
Be careful this time.

35:49.210 --> 35:49.960
I...

35:50.800 --> 35:53.030
Although I'm smart and powerful,

35:53.030 --> 35:54.370
and the reincarnation of the lucky child,

35:54.370 --> 35:56.810
it's my first time hunting demons. I'm inexperienced.

35:56.810 --> 35:57.990
Brother, you...

35:58.150 --> 35:59.880
Are you so confident

35:59.880 --> 36:01.280
to let me charge forward?

36:04.660 --> 36:05.710
That day,

36:06.430 --> 36:08.110
who lied to me?

36:12.470 --> 36:13.150
Brother!

36:15.120 --> 36:16.380
Brother, I was wrong.

36:17.010 --> 36:19.110
You just want me to be the bait, right?

36:19.320 --> 36:20.830
Then I'll go.

36:22.890 --> 36:24.990
I always do this.

37:06.610 --> 37:07.210
Watch out!

37:09.590 --> 37:10.480
Demon!

37:10.480 --> 37:11.740
Don't come to me.

37:11.740 --> 37:13.540
I'm not tasty at all.

37:16.730 --> 37:17.780
Don't come to me.

37:17.780 --> 37:18.710
Don't come to me.

37:19.080 --> 37:20.010
Don't come to me.

38:31.660 --> 38:32.250
Xue.

38:40.350 --> 38:41.010
Be careful.

39:26.680 --> 39:27.350
Liu Shao.

40:24.970 --> 40:25.560
Liu Shao.

40:26.440 --> 40:27.170
Are you okay?

40:41.390 --> 40:42.050
Be careful.

41:18.390 --> 41:19.110
Xue.

41:20.070 --> 41:21.200
-Xue! -Xue, wake up.

41:25.070 --> 41:25.700
Xue.

41:26.710 --> 41:27.260
Xue.

41:28.850 --> 41:29.520
Liu Shao.

41:32.880 --> 41:33.940
Where is Wang Jian?

41:34.520 --> 41:35.580
Where is Wang Jian?

42:12.950 --> 42:14.250
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

42:14.250 --> 42:15.810
I never did evil before.

42:15.810 --> 42:16.650
I was captured recently

42:16.650 --> 42:18.070
and has been sealed.

42:18.070 --> 42:19.040
Until two days ago,

42:19.040 --> 42:20.300
he released me.

42:20.300 --> 42:21.640
I was driven by the demon controling seal,

42:21.640 --> 42:22.900
so I attacked humans.

42:22.900 --> 42:24.900
Your Majesty, please spare my life.

42:50.580 --> 42:52.850
Thank you, Your Majesty. Thank you, Your Majesty.

42:52.850 --> 42:54.740
The spell in your body has been removed.

42:54.740 --> 42:56.920
I'll cut off your demon power for 30 years.

42:56.920 --> 42:57.850
You may leave.

42:57.850 --> 42:58.980
Yes.

43:05.240 --> 43:06.500
Wang Jian.

43:09.730 --> 43:10.740
Who are you?

43:10.740 --> 43:11.740
Tell me your name.

43:17.170 --> 43:18.300
Demon King in White?

43:18.850 --> 43:19.850
Why is he here?

43:20.430 --> 43:21.530
Miss Liu Shao.

43:23.000 --> 43:24.100
My name is Kho.

43:24.100 --> 43:24.980
I'm your demon.

43:25.150 --> 43:27.160
My demon? Kho?
